      "current_stock": 100
    }
    // Additional inventory details follow..
  ]
}
```

Promotions Schedule (promotions_schedule.json):
```json
{
  "promotions": [
    {
      "product_id": "HX12",
      "start_date": "2023-06-01",
      "end_date": "2023-06-15",
      "expected_increase": 20
    },
    {
      "product_id": "BM45",
      "start_date": "2023-06-20",
      "end_date": "2023-07-05",
      "expected_increase": 25
    }
    // Further promotion details follow..
  ]
}
```

Please use this information to generate a demand forecast for the upcoming three months.

