- log: commit history, newest first, who changed a file or what changed in it; optional n, path, author, grep (text in the commit message), base (only commits this branch has that the base branch lacks)
- diff: all uncommitted changes as a patch; staged=true for only the staged ones; base for what this branch changed since it left the base branch; optional path
- show: one commit with its patch; optional rev (default HEAD)
- blame: line-by-line attribution of who wrote each specific line of a file (not for whole-file history); needs path
